    "title": "Four repeated-action patterns",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-phrases-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Four repeated-action patterns",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Repeating a verb around movement words suggests repeated action. Repeating it with the ongoing marker leads into something that happens during it. Paired negatives deny both parts; the say-and-act frame conveys immediate action.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他走来走去。",
                "pinyin": "tā zǒu lái zǒu qù 。",
                "meaning": "He walks back and forth.",
                "audio": "751cc9f5022d5f1dcec78b2f115258835ca6ba59eb0c6595ee72e69e530e7cc7"
              },
              {
                "text": "说着说着，大家都笑了。",
                "pinyin": "shuō zhe shuō zhe ， dàjiā dōu xiào le 。",
                "meaning": "As they kept talking, everyone started laughing.",
                "audio": "3d9d3896953f3e3a1ed3c36c02631e02fdcefdd9ea2674a29cfe1114cbb5d175"
              },
              {
                "text": "我们没吃没喝。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen méi chī méi hē 。",
                "meaning": "We have had neither food nor drink.",
                "audio": "7683196c4b28aba394d9b4cd80ed9e9276f9df4b191a2ff74d881d2d4855ec02"
              },
              {
                "text": "他说走就走。",
                "pinyin": "tā shuō zǒu jiù zǒu 。",
                "meaning": "He leaves as soon as he says he will.",
                "audio": "fcbec079c88905a50d401cd327c5fbd136d7aea418d646d7e85fbaf0efab7e78"
              }
            ]
          },
